  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Technical Smart Grid Workshops, through MFM Lamey Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding supported two one-day Turkey Technical Smart Grid Workshops held in Turkey in 2013. These technical workshops followed a successful USTDA-funded Smart Grid Workshop in February 2013 and allowed U.S. vendors and Turkish electricity distribution and transmission companies to deepen their commercial ties by discussing specific solutions to Turkeys grid modernization needs.</narrative>
  </description>
